        "# f-strings\n",
        "\n",
        "F-strings are formatted string literals whose replacement fields are evaluated and formatted at runtime, as in `f\"{value:.2f}\"`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-f-strings)"
      ]
